---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/mindfulness/SectionHeading.astro';
import { pathTo } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<Layout title="Shipping Policy" description="Mindfulness Candle Collection shipping policy — order processing, delivery estimates, and assistance.">
    <section class="section-padding bg-cream pt-32">
        <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <SectionHeading eyebrow="Policies" title="Shipping Policy" align="center" />

            <div class="card-static p-8 sm:p-12 space-y-8 text-warm-gray leading-relaxed font-light">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Order Processing</h3>
                    <p>Standard retail orders are generally processed within three to five business days, excluding weekends and holidays. Corporate, healthcare, wholesale, fundraising, customized, and high-volume orders may require additional production time.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Shipping Times</h3>
                    <p>Shipping estimates begin after order processing and do not include production time. Delivery dates provided by shipping carriers are estimates and are not guaranteed.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Order Tracking</h3>
                    <p>When tracking information is available, it will be sent to the email address provided during checkout.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Multiple Shipments</h3>
                    <p>Orders containing multiple products may arrive in separate shipments.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Incorrect Addresses</h3>
                    <p>Customers are responsible for providing a complete and accurate shipping address. Additional shipping fees resulting from an incorrect or incomplete address may be the customer's responsibility.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Damaged Orders</h3>
                    <p>If your order arrives damaged, please contact us within five calendar days of delivery. Include your order number, photographs of the shipping container, packaging, and damaged product so that we may evaluate the claim.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-charcoal mb-3 font-serif text-xl">Temperature-Sensitive Products</h3>
                    <p>Candles may be affected by extreme temperatures. We monitor seasonal conditions and may adjust fulfillment timing when reasonably necessary to protect product quality.</p>
                </div>
                <p>For shipping assistance, contact <a href="mailto:info@mindfulnesscandle.store" class="text-sage-dark font-medium">info@mindfulnesscandle.store</a>.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center mt-10">
                <a href={pathTo('/policies/returns')} class="btn btn-outline text-charcoal border-charcoal/30">Return Policy</a>
                <a href={pathTo('/policies/subscription')} class="btn btn-outline text-charcoal border-charcoal/30">Subscription Policy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
